{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1560174-forsaken-in-savannah","id":1560174,"title":"Forsaken in Savannah","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-05-24T09:06:31-07:00","id":1560174,"title":"Forsaken in Savannah","content":"Usually I don\u2019t have many questions but it looks like it\u2019s gonna be that kind of week! Have any of you played a chronicle in Savannah and if so would you mind telling me about your setting? I was thinking of pretty much copy pasting Bristol but the more I look at it the more I think Savannah needs some more unique stuff. For instance, ghost tourism is very popular there, maybe there\u2019s some reason for that?<br /> <br /> just copy and pasted this from the simple questions thread. Thanks in advance for any help!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28463-bwhite24","name":"Bwhite24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-25T07:45:21-07:00","id":1560209,"title":"","content":"One of the Forum members created his own Savannah setting, including Uratha:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\">The young man in the cafe's Savannah Georgia setting writeup</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-25T19:33:42-07:00","id":1560220,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Teatime</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1560174-forsaken-in-savannah?p=1560209#post1560209\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One of the Forum members created his own Savannah setting, including Uratha:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\">The young man in the cafe's Savannah Georgia setting writeup</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Holy schmoly, thanks for that lob!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28463-bwhite24","name":"Bwhite24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-29T12:39:52-07:00","id":1560257,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bwhite24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1560174-forsaken-in-savannah?p=1560220#post1560220\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Holy schmoly, thanks for that lob!</div> </div> </div> </div>Worth noting that I wrote that setting during the period when my family was gearing up to move here, but before we actually did. I would definitely do it differently if I wrote it up today, and in fact am writing a Requiem city book for Savannah for the ST vault, but if you want a local's perspective, let me know because not only is that write up missing a lot of local eye info, it is a decade old and the city has had some developments in that time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 05-29-2026, 03:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-06-10T11:46:29-07:00","id":1560532,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1560174-forsaken-in-savannah?p=1560257#post1560257\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Worth noting that I wrote that setting during the period when my family was gearing up to move here, but before we actually did. I would definitely do it differently if I wrote it up today, and in fact am writing a Requiem city book for Savannah for the ST vault, but if you want a local's perspective, let me know because not only is that write up missing a lot of local eye info, it is a decade old and the city has had some developments in that time.</div> </div> </div> </div>Awesome! Gotta let me know when that boom comes out on Storytellers vault.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28463-bwhite24","name":"Bwhite24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-06-10T13:31:33-07:00","id":1560533,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bwhite24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1560174-forsaken-in-savannah?p=1560532#post1560532\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Awesome! Gotta let me know when that boom comes out on Storytellers vault.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Will do. And since this is originally a Forsaken thread, I\u2019ll just say that in my current write up of the area that I\u2019m making now that I\u2019m actually living here, I have most werewolf activity in Savannah be based out of the city of Darien to the south, with a little bit in the appropriately named Moon River area.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-19T20:05:44-07:00","id":1564206,"title":"","content":"I've been to Georgia coast many, many times (St. Simons); I've visited Darien and Savannah. Mostly when I think of that area, I think of a Dark Eras game (Requiem). I've been all over the Altamaha-River. I always pictured a Foresaken-game around Fort King George, back in the day. Oh, and plantation-houses, were work-houses; the real house, was back in Savannah; that's where the wealthy, plantation-owners wanted to live. <br /> <br /> Right now, I'm working on a Southern-City (New Orleans), in a PC-game editor, (American-Conquest). It's got a screenshot, the entire map function, so we'll see I have can save it to a .jpg. The game itself is for Requiem, but, it takes place in Colonial/Antebellum-times; so there's vampire that's been living their for decades when new vamps from the Old World decide to claim it. The older New World vamp isn't as worried. The problems they'll face, isn't other vampires, but spirits, lupines and god knows what else dwells in the swamps. The Old-Worlders are stuck in the city because the spirits can't get in to mess with them, well, not as much. <br /> <br /> And I have yet ANOTHER idea, I got while there, was, a native-American kingdom, an Elizabethan-colony and a freed-slave kingdom along the Altamaha river. But, honestly, I've been thinking how that could be a D&amp;D-game. <br /> <br /> I'm working on a theory that native-American Uratha are a variant of the Pure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}